.title Test Basic
Simple test with backticks: `<!name>`

.title Test Conditional
<?user.premium bool>
Premium user with `backticks`
<else>
Regular user with `backticks`
</user.premium>

.title Test Nested
<?outer>
Outer start
<?inner>
Inner content
</inner>
Outer end
</outer>

.title Test Comparison
<?age int gte 18>
You are an adult (age: <!age>)
<else>
You are a minor (age: <!age>)
</age> 